---
import C from "../components/C.astro";
import HeroDemo from "../components/HeroDemo.astro";
import P from "../components/P.astro";
---

<section id="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title" class="flow">
  <h1 id="hero-title" class="mb-5 w-fit scroll-mt-20 font-[550] text-kumo-strong">Product demos on your real UI</h1>
  <P>
    Your hero demo is a 6 MB video that went stale the week after you recorded it. <C>playthru</C> plays the demo on the
    interface itself: a cursor glides, clicks and types, and a camera zooms in on what matters.
  </P>
  <P>
    Write the script once, as a chain of steps. It stays sharp at any size, follows your theme, never drifts out of date
    with the product, and weighs about 4.6 KB.
  </P>
  <HeroDemo />
</section>
